What this is

A single-file, dependency-free Node.js CLI that loads notification templates, substitutes variables ({{var}}), and posts to Slack or Teams webhooks (or emits email text to stdout/file). Supports dry-run, template directory override, per-service webhook override, and safe environment-variable webhook usage (no secrets in repo).

